{
  "notes": ["Values reset at the start of every session from State.curr_prestige (res://Scripts/Battle/BattleScene.gd:55-358).", "Prestige 12 and above use the else branch; prestige 13-25 then override enemy_xp, node_boost and bit_value.", "The second \"== 19\" branch (res://Scripts/Battle/BattleScene.gd:327) is unreachable because the first \"== 19\" matches first, so its values (xp 58, bit_value 50) are never used. Listed under overridesUnreachable.", "enemy HP/damage grow linearly: base + growth_per_sec * t, where t is seconds since the session started (res://Scripts/Battle/EnemySpawner.gd:70-71). Enemies keep the HP/damage they spawned with.", "health_loss_per_sec is the constant \"virus\" drain on the player (res://Scripts/Battle/BattleScene.gd:362-365). It does not grow during a session.", "Exploder (if bought) takes its weight from Square: Square -= exploder_spawn_chance, Exploder = exploder_spawn_chance (res://Scripts/Battle/BattleScene.gd:356-358).", "Max prestige is 25; beating the P25 boss gives no new prestige (res://Scripts/Battle/BattleScene.gd:416-419)."],
